                                                "sense_id": "6ce01886-3c4c-32cd-b477-d249058877d9",
                                                "text": "When the war in Korea began he was recalled by the Navy, serving as a boilerman technician. He came to New York in 1952, joined the Actors Studio and began to get parts both onstage and in films."
